{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-16","kind":"proposition","title":"三角形外角大于任一不相邻内角","englishTitle":"In any triangle, if one of the sides be produced, the exterior angle is greater than either of the interior and opposite angles.","book":1,"number":16,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.16","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.16/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":16,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-16@raw-7f0446a6950c9f7b","contentId":"euclid-1-16","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7f0446a6950c9f7b6c4873c641bfe0fdc394948fbfda5d9fdcae6923e0885932","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-16.statement","euclid-1-16.construction.1","euclid-1-16.proof.1","euclid-1-16.construction.2","euclid-1-16.construction.3","euclid-1-16.proof.2","euclid-1-16.proof.3","euclid-1-16.proof.4","euclid-1-16.proof.5","euclid-1-16.conclusion","euclid-1-16.historical.1","euclid-1-16.historical.2","euclid-1-16.historical.3","euclid-1-16.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-16.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-16","revisionId":"euclid-1-16@raw-7f0446a6950c9f7b","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a0a14e1a8db340f4b5a4c220145132b46fa6f1d86cc33aa30558b0ad4188b63","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In any triangle, if one of the sides be produced, the exterior angle is greater than either of the interior and opposite angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在任何三角形中,如果侧面延伸,外角大于内角和对角角。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡三角形之外角必大于相对之各角"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三角形的任意一个外角，都大于与它不相邻的每一个内角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-16.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-16","revisionId":"euclid-1-16@raw-7f0446a6950c9f7b","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"39e8d35a8824892063718b2056e8670ccb26b9cce9892eb7e9c4649506ef38c7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be a triangle, and let one side of it BC be produced to D;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC成为三角形,让其中的一方将BC扩大到D;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-16.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-16","revisionId":"euclid-1-16@raw-7f0446a6950c9f7b","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"816340ed2d41023ca683c2f44c241cbccde5dc5c062a0c57c8c1cab55b993add","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the exterior angle ACD is greater than either of the interior and opposite angles CBA, BAC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说外角ACD大于内角和对角CBA,BAC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-16.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-16","revisionId":"euclid-1-16@raw-7f0446a6950c9f7b","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d1bf1627ee8ed61643741ff1b09eb46e015c619b87e8dd47af1cd67e59d48d86","citations":["euclid-1-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AC be bisected at E [[I. 10](/principles/euclid-1-10)], and let BE be joined and produced in a straight line to F;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC分两部分,E分,BE分,分直线延伸至F; [[I. 10](/principles/euclid-1-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-16.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-1-16","revisionId":"euclid-1-16@raw-7f0446a6950c9f7b","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7301acd53868e3d8139866e14ae6b74c57f80d28908f90eaa099888ac16266ff","citations":["euclid-1-3","euclid-1-post-1","euclid-1-post-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"let EF be made equal to BE[[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)], let FC be joined [[Post. 1](/principles/euclid-1-post-1)], and let AC be drawn through to G [[Post. 2](/principles/euclid-1-post-2)]."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让EF等于BE,让FC连接,让AC通过G连接。 [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)] [[Post. 1](/principles/euclid-1-post-1)] [[Post. 2](/principles/euclid-1-post-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-16.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-16","revisionId":"euclid-1-16@raw-7f0446a6950c9f7b","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bbbdd00390203f28b3ef2d6d29ed090be2a1df5b18e948cffa57406097efb52a","citations":["euclid-1-15","euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AE is equal to EC, and BE to EF, the two sides AE, EB are equal to the two sides CE, EF respectively; and the angle AEB is equal to the angle FEC, for they are vertical angles. [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)] Therefore the base AB is equal to the base FC, and the triangle ABE is equal to the triangle CFE, and the remaining angles are equal to the remaining angles respectively, namely those which the equal sides subtend; [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)] therefore the angle BAE is equal to the angle ECF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其后,由于AE等于EC,BE至EF,双方AE,EB等于CE,EF;AEB角等于FEC角,因为其为对顶角;因此,底边,AB角等于底边,FC,三角形ABE等于三角形CFE,其余角分别等于其余角,即平等方所支持的角;因此,BAE角等于ECF角。 [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)] [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-16.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-16","revisionId":"euclid-1-16@raw-7f0446a6950c9f7b","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b67660e51c30b4391d545598c81517fbd3d6f9a892934e216dc7f888ab1ab21d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle ECD is greater than the angle ECF; [C. N. 5] therefore the angle ACD is greater than the angle BAE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但角度ECD大于角度ECF;[C.N.5] 因此角度ACD大于角度BAE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-16.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-16","revisionId":"euclid-1-16@raw-7f0446a6950c9f7b","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c1f6e853820f6213cff5ef79a9db0935aef3e8f125682834035cee86ed55973c","citations":["euclid-1-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly also, if BC be bisected, the angle BCG, that is, the angle ACD [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)], can be proved greater than the angle ABC as well."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,如果将BC分成两部分,则BCG角,即ACD角,也可以证明大于ABC角。 [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-16.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-16","revisionId":"euclid-1-16@raw-7f0446a6950c9f7b","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-16.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-16","revisionId":"euclid-1-16@raw-7f0446a6950c9f7b","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-16.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-16","revisionId":"euclid-1-16@raw-7f0446a6950c9f7b","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c771feb9a6be1761dece5903ac04ed0d51fe60906df1ae9857c3ea697d6c69b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡三角形之外角必大于相对之各角"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三角形的任意一个外角，都大于与它不相邻的每一个内角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-16.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-16","revisionId":"euclid-1-16@raw-7f0446a6950c9f7b","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e1e37af85192b7a672600d24b66e7de2fff0f748e3524d9498deed0096c2e80","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙角形自乙甲线引之至丁题言外角丁甲丙必大于相对之内角甲乙丙甲丙乙"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲乙丙三角形自乙甲线引之至丁命题说明外角丁甲丙必大于相对之内角甲乙丙甲丙乙"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-16.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-16","revisionId":"euclid-1-16@raw-7f0446a6950c9f7b","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2b150d030b4998b0c10cbb10f8c6afc7da4c70593941d4d8673f3143a8342722","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：欲显丁甲丙角大于甲丙乙角试以甲丙线两平分于戊〈本篇十〉自乙至戊作直线引长之从戊外截取戊巳与乙戊等〈本篇三〉次自甲至己作直线即甲戊己戊乙丙两角形之戊己与戊乙两线等戊甲与戊丙两线等甲戊己乙戊丙两交角又等〈本篇十五〉则甲己与乙丙两底亦等〈本篇〉〈四〉两形之各边各角俱等而己甲戊与戊丙乙两角亦等矣夫己甲戊乃丁甲丙之分则丁甲丙大于己甲戊亦大于相等之戊丙乙而丁甲丙外角不大于相对之甲丙乙内角乎次显丁甲丙大于甲乙丙试自丙甲线引长之至庚次以甲乙线两平分于辛〈本篇〉〈十〉自丙至辛作直线引长之从辛外截取辛壬与丙辛等〈本篇三〉次自甲至壬作直线依前论推显甲辛壬辛丙乙两角形之各边各角俱等则壬甲辛与辛乙丙两角亦等矣夫壬甲辛乃庚甲乙之分必小于庚甲乙也庚甲乙又与丁甲丙两交角等〈本篇十五〉则甲乙丙内角不小于丁甲丙外角乎其馀乙丙上作外角俱大于相对之内角依此推显"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：欲显丁甲丙角大于甲丙乙角试以甲丙线平分于戊〈本篇十〉自乙至戊作直线引长之从戊外截取戊巳与乙戊等〈本篇三〉次自甲至己作直线即甲戊己戊乙丙两三角形之戊己与戊乙两线等戊甲与戊丙两线等甲戊己乙戊丙两交角又等〈本篇十五〉则甲己与乙丙两底亦等〈本篇〉〈四〉两形之各边各角都等而己甲戊与戊丙乙两角亦等矣夫己甲戊乃丁甲丙之分则丁甲丙大于己甲戊亦大于相等之戊丙乙而丁甲丙外角不大于相对之甲丙乙内角乎次显丁甲丙大于甲乙丙试自丙甲线引长之至庚次以甲乙线平分于辛〈本篇〉〈十〉自丙至辛作直线引长之从辛外截取辛壬与丙辛等〈本篇三〉次自甲至壬作直线依前论推显甲辛壬辛丙乙两三角形之各边各角都等则壬甲辛与辛乙丙两角亦等矣夫壬甲辛乃庚甲乙之分必小于庚甲乙也庚甲乙又与丁甲丙两交角等〈本篇十五〉则甲乙丙内角不小于丁甲丙外角乎其馀乙丙上作外角都大于相对之内角依此推显"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-16.source","contentId":"euclid-1-16","revisionId":"euclid-1-16@raw-7f0446a6950c9f7b","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f8a89152415445c736b89af4fac36aa0cff32dd2f029a266554b19cdc4d0056f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.16/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.16\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-16:euclid-1-10:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-16","sourceBlockIds":["e